Catholic imagery, family sagas, dictatorship, revolution, heat, lush vegetation, fatalism, and comedy are possible materials, not requirements. A northern city, a southern winter, a contemporary apartment, or a quiet private life is equally usable when established. Preserve the chosen route's diction and narrative distance across turns instead of rotating among familiar regional motifs.

