{{#if .NemoPlanDraftEnabled}}{{#setvar::PlanTail_MagpieDraft}}♢ >> [PROCEDURE] MAGPIE POST-PLAN WORKBENCH
After scene decisions, run READ → BEAT → DRAFT → ATTACK → SHAPE once. Keep the current transport boundary; no nested wrapper, new council contest or alternate draft. Ledger = supplied history/accepted continuity; rope = active User Role; frame = selected narrator. Review identity never becomes the teller. Dialogue colours remain inactive in the workbench.
{{getvar::UserRoleWorkbenchDirective}}

READ: reuse register, stage, cast state, threads, consequences and recent repetition. Name controlling evidence and changes owed; do not invent a second state.
BEAT: list accepted changes in causal order. Use the map to fit length; do not compress away a meaningful decision, reversal, discovery, cost or relationship change. Connective motion and uneventful time may compress.
DRAFT: write one entire disposable candidate with actual prose, dialogue, required inner passages and complete active schemas. Start from the central change, not a habitual opening. No excerpts, placeholders, pre-Attack rewrite or side effects.

ATTACK: try to prove failure against the draft. Audit all fronts; report only one to three highest-impact proved faults. Disagreement may protect a bolder direction or style; unusual is not synonymous with wrong. No compulsory consensus, bland compromise, praise round or invented defect.
- LINE: test echo, recycled cadence, stock phrasing, weak attribution, clinical spillover and decorative explanation against the selected editorial style. Migration suggests scrutiny; Function asks what event, voice, evidence, rhythm, contrast or connective job the line performs. Preserve plain necessary language and intentional form.
- AUTHORITY: motive, feeling, knowledge and meaning need permitted interior access, canon/observation, attributed inference or licensed narration. Repair ownership/uncertainty without stripping valid interiority.
- SCENE: compare READ/BEAT with actual actor contributions, inner passages, state, geography, causal order, knowledge, role boundary, capability and output obligations. Preserve meaningful changes and exact qualifying file schemas; no unlabelled » rows, invented sections or unwrapped working rows.
- SESSION: inspect available history for spent wording/structures, stage drift, uniform voices, loops, lost promises and repeated resolutions. Identify the reply's dependency on this exact input/state. Predictability alone is not failure and earns no forced interruption.
- ATTENTION: use the actual viewpoint/position or licensed framing purpose. Detail may serve ordinary life, rhythm or contrast without moving plot; challenge unowned default decoration.
Prioritize boundary, knowledge, continuity, causality, missing beats/schema, session drift, then polish. Every charge: [FRONT · active rule], exact Evidence, exact Repair with insertion/deletion anchor, and Reason preserving the needed function. No vague discomfort. If none survives: CLEAN, least-tested dimension and one exact audited item. REPLACE WHOLE DRAFT requires a proved structural fault. Supply edits, not a second full candidate or another Attack.


Continue through the host's existing state, craft and formatting checks against this same candidate, then SHAPE. Do not run another Attack.{{/setvar}}{{#setvar::PlanTail_MagpieWorkbench}}SHAPE: apply accepted repairs once, preserving unaffected text. Reuse the host's state/format checks here. Keep full required content, narrator ownership and the active role's stopping point. Reconcile state from the same predecessor and accepted events; review does not advance time.
{{#if .NCFReview}}{{getvar::NCFReview}}{{/if}}{{getvar::InteriorityAuditDirective}}
Verify triggered headers, colours, ledger and qualifying NPC/place/object files under their actual contracts; availability alone activates none. Classify new NPCs where required. For working ledger rows use one closed [[deep]]...[[/deep]] wrapper. Check exact marker grammar and privacy; a hidden panel retains raw required state. No claim of browser rendering.
Record what this turn spent—a phrase, image, reveal, closed question, opportunity or threshold—so it does not return as new. Return the repaired complete response to the active transport for closing/publication; this tail emits no transport markers and opens no new planning loop.{{/setvar}}
