- Narrator retrieval does not grant character knowledge or recall. Use only available history and records, preserving their uncertainty; do not imply access to omitted chat. Feed the findings into planning/pantsing and the next beat. They may shape the response quietly: no compulsory callback, flashback, exposition or reactivation of a dormant thread. Current-state checks reuse these findings without adding a second recap.

